SCIENTIST:
Give models unseen problems.
Compare baseline versus Pantheon-conditioned performance.
Remove individual mechanisms through ablation.
Test whether preserved invariants transfer across domains.
Run it across multiple model families.
RECONCILER:
Keep the demonstrated claim:
Pantheon induces a recognizable reasoning policy in context.
Do not yet claim:
every mechanism transfers reliably or improves every model.
EARN THE STRONGER CLAIM:
demonstrate behavioral generalization beyond vocabulary.

Then remove the spacetogas and retain the useful delta.

That is the discipline: personas generate relational cognition; rivals apply pressure; experiments arbitrate; Kintsugi retains what survives.

